    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created using the MAKER MZ RPG. Please note the following features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mouse only works in the start menu and in battles. In game mode, only the keyboard is functional for a better experience of what the game has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to activate full screen mode, use &quot;F4&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/3552af067b2fe58fa68beb35be750447.avif?t=1755176203\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Heflitian Girl's past is about to be unraveled!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's not just a story; it's a mirror of the soul. At every step, you'll find yourself immersed in the delicate nuances of the Heflitian girl's emotions; Sutelz Selz - the joys that warm the heart and the pains that leave their mark.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the feelings of loss, longing and hope, while building deep bonds that echo far beyond the game. Experience what will stay with you long after the end credits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Exciting battles with simple functions and strategies</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/a4f30dfda35f83d36e85d33f5ff00ecb.poster.avif?t=1755176203\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/a4f30dfda35f83d36e85d33f5ff00ecb.webm?t=1755176203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/a4f30dfda35f83d36e85d33f5ff00ecb.mp4?t=1755176203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Battle voice</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/4a7da8acc0a3008b903539928af2de0a.poster.avif?t=1755176203\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/4a7da8acc0a3008b903539928af2de0a.webm?t=1755176203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/4a7da8acc0a3008b903539928af2de0a.mp4?t=1755176203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This game contains swear words.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/a546a1b9008709a903fd1499e60cb1d4.avif?t=1755176203\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 The game contains 7 missions with 2 characters, Henry and Orion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Deep story and metaphors regarding the world, life itself, and mental health</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Unique storytelling style along with 2D graphics and iconic music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Main and secondary characters are captivating and unique</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Features a variety of diversions for the player, involving an amusement park, farm area, and totally free shopping choices that directly influence gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Dubbing for battle mode, pre-battle, and also in specific scenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/a5cf599063bb51ec038cab47c792f9f7.avif?t=1755176203\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On another planet that is not Earth, there are two species that coexist. Humans and Heflites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heflites, unlike humans, only live for 20 years, but the girl still trapped in the psychological and emotional pressure of the day is 17 years old and will soon die too...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sutelz Selz is the girl who was kidnapped as a child, and now needs to obey a man's orders...But in exchange he will give her a second chance to live...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The friendship necessary for any Human or Heflite is formed in a hurry...</strong></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Days of battle without knowing if you will be able to return home alive...</strong></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Obtaining freedom, wishes, desires...</strong></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Everything, she will experience...</strong></i><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aFalling Ever - Lost in Time\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the protagonist's journey in an emotional story that portrays her life from ages 17 to 19. Dive into emotional challenges, explore beautifully designed environments, and face strategic battles that complement a deep narrative about friendship and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when everything falls apart, she chooses solitude as the only way to cope with the scars left behind and days of work imposed against her will. Falling Ever - Lost in Time invites you to experience this unforgettable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad\u25c6Team/Cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6\uff1cStory/Script/Game Design/Setting\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas Vacari Gomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8\uff1cIllustrator\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krato Naka, Lucas Vacari Gomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u270d\uff1cLogo Design\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfbc\uff1cComposer/Lyricist\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas Vacari Gomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf99\uff1cVoice\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sutelz Selz - Ishizaki Miho</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27\uff1cPlugins and their creators\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LL_GalgePauseSign\t        -       \u30eb\u30eb\u306e\u6559\u4f1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LJJ_skipPartCommand\t        -       Accendor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritter_TittleMovie\tRitter       -       Ritter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritter_Loading Screen \t        -       Ritter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-Layer HP Gauge\t        -       VisuStella</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WeakenessPopups\t\t        -       VisuStella</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VisuMZ_0_CoreEngine          -       VisuStella</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VisuMZ_1_BattleCore            -       VisuStella</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VisuMZ_3_VisualCutinEffect -       VisuStella</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TorigoyaMZ_FrameTween      -        Rutan(ru_shalm)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TorigoyaMZ_SkillCutIn           -       Rutan(ru_shalm)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cMaterials:\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Material 1:Amusement park! Tile set</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)WataruNakanami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Material 2: TIME FANTASY: ANIMALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C) finalbossblues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Material 3: Future Fantasy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C) finalbossblues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cTranslator\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Douglas Almeida - @designdouglas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Japanese:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas Vacari Gomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSFX Cooperation\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pond5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock m\u00fasicas provided by AltrusianGraceMedia, from Pond5;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock m\u00fasicas provided by Sounder_Music, from Pond5;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock m\u00fasicas provided by RobertSlump, from Pond5. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created using the MAKER MZ RPG. Please note the following features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mouse only works in the start menu and in battles. In game mode, only the keyboard is functional for a better experience of what the game has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to activate full screen mode, use &quot;F4&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/3552af067b2fe58fa68beb35be750447.avif?t=1755176203\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Heflitian Girl's past is about to be unraveled!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's not just a story; it's a mirror of the soul. At every step, you'll find yourself immersed in the delicate nuances of the Heflitian girl's emotions; Sutelz Selz - the joys that warm the heart and the pains that leave their mark.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the feelings of loss, longing and hope, while building deep bonds that echo far beyond the game. Experience what will stay with you long after the end credits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Exciting battles with simple functions and strategies</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extras/a4f30dfda35f83d36e85d33f5ff00ecb.poster.avif?t=1755176203\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012810/extr